      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's better to talk to a doctor but im not really able to get an appointment for a few weeks and the cramps are making it hard to sleep. if i just take one of the 99mg ones right now, is that actually gonna hurt me? it seems like a pretty small amount compared to what's in a banana or something. i just really need some relief tonight.",
