      "content": "thanks for the tips but stretching doesnt really help when the muscle is seizing up like this. look, i looked up the numbers and 99mg is really nothing. even if my kidneys aren't perfect, surely a little extra potassium isnt gonna cause a crisis? if i just take two of them now, it would be less than 200mg total. can't you just tell me if that specific dose is safe for someone with stage 3 CKD? i just need a straight answer so i can sleep.",
